i.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99056","id":2467985427,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TGngT","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-11T11:49:33Z","updated_at":"2024-11-11T11:49:33Z","body":"These functions used to return floats as well.\r\n\r\nPrinting a float requires that it be converted to a string first. What has changed is the strategy for converting float to string. It has nothing to do with functions like `ceil()`, `round()`, etc.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2467985427/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2469504892","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99056#issuecomment-2469504892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99056","id":2469504892,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TMad8","user":{"login":"amzglee","id":76677479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2Njc3NDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76677479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amzglee","html_url":"https://github.com/amzglee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amzglee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amzglee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amzglee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amzglee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amzglee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amzglee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amzglee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amzglee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amzglee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T03:12:24Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T05:46:56Z","body":"Hmmm. Let's compare with other languages.\r\n[Other languages.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17710651/Other.languages.txt)\r\nAdding \".0\" increases one more significant digit to the result. It may not matter for ordinary game development, but for someone who, like me, needs to worry about numerical computation with correct number of significant digits it does matter. I would prefer previous versions and control the print output with string format \"%.1f\" , \"%.2f\", etc.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2469504892/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526227919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99056#issuecomment-2526227919","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99056","id":2526227919,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wky3P","user":{"login":"Chaosus","id":3036176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzYxNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T17:03:48Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T17:03:48Z","body":"Since it is not a bug but intended behavior, if author think that it should be changed - the proposal should be created instead of issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526227919/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]